**Mousefolk** (/' *mawsfowk* /, Scripts) are a humanoid race resembling mouses.

# Appearance

# Other Planes

# Powers and Abilities 

## Keen Senses
You have proficiency in the Perception skill.

## Mousefolk Weapon Training
You have proficiency with the rapier, shortsword, shortbow, and handaxe.

## Nimble Dodge
When attacked by an attack of opportunity, you may use your reaction to impose disadvantage on that attack.
